, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryh.jpg"}, {"id": 1809167, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryn.jpg"}, {"id": 1809172, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12rys.jpg"}, {"id": 1809176, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryw.jpg"}, {"id": 1809164, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryk.jpg"}, {"id": 1809165, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryl.jpg"}, {"id": 1809166, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12rym.jpg"}, {"id": 1809173, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryt.jpg"}, {"id": 1809174, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryu.jpg"}, {"id": 1809168, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryo.jpg"}, {"id": 1809169, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryp.jpg"}, {"id": 1809170, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryq.jpg"}, {"id": 1809178, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ryy.jpg"}, {"id": 1809180, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12rz0.jpg"}, {"id": 1809181, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12rz1.jpg"}, {"id": 1809183, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12rz3.jpg"}], "slug": "every-step-has-a-sound", "storyline": "You play as an independent programmer living a quiet and simple life. One day, you receive a request for help from a company that specializes in gold mining deep within cave systems. They inform you that one of their technical systems has failed and they need someone capable of fixing it.\n\nWhat seems like a simple technical job quickly turns into something far more mysterious.\n\nAfter arriving at the site, you find the place unexpectedly empty. There is no one to guide you, and no clear explanation of what is happening. All you know is that you came here to repair the system\u2026 but every step forward reveals something new.\n\nInside the dark caves, you will face puzzles and obstacles that require careful thinking and focus to overcome. As you continue deeper, the place slowly begins to reveal its secrets.\n\nExplore the environment, solve puzzles, and uncover what this company is hiding deep beneath the earth.\n\nBut remember\u2026\n\nSome discoveries can be more dangerous than gold itself.", "summary": "An atmospheric horror puzzle game where an independent programmer answers a request from a gold mining company and finds himself alone inside mysterious caves hiding dangerous secrets", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/every-step-has-a-sound"}